  FreeInk SDK
  https://github.com/Free-Ink/freeink-sdk
  Commit: 6a208c0c46cce99bafa334bc4f171f5e558c5195
  License: MIT
  Copyright (c) 2026 FreeInk

Display / board support:
  M5GFX / LovyanGFX
  https://github.com/m5stack/M5GFX
  License: MIT (LovyanGFX) / M5Stack

3D hardware:
  M5Stack PaperDIY Complete Kit structure (original)
  https://github.com/m5stack/M5_Hardware/tree/master/Products/K159-B_PaperDIY_Complete_Kit/Structures
  License: MIT
  Copyright (c) 2021 M5Stack
  Remix: hardware/3d/PaperDIY_kit_completo.3mf
